OL,5,G0105 Dogs Behaving (Very) Badly
OL,6,     FGroomer Marie takes her beloved
OL,7,     FPekingese four pack to work - but
OL,8,     Fthey're scaring off the furry
OL,9,     Fclientele. And a couple's
OL,10,     Fscreaming Frenchie is driving a
OL,11,     Fwedge between them.
OL,12,G0205 Dogs Behaving (Very) Badly
OL,13,     FCan Graeme Hall stop a Cockerpoo's
OL,14,     Fdirty obsession, and also curtail
OL,15,     FZiggy from ransacking his owner's
OL,16,     Fhouse? Plus, the basics of sit and
OL,17,     Fstay - but without having to say a
OL,18,     Fword.
